  "highlight": "Shane Moraghan crossed the English Channel from England to France in 10 hours 23 minutes on 7 August 1999.",
  "biography": [
    "Moraghan landed on a beach between Wissant and Cap Gris-Nez in 1999. Seventeen years later he finished first in his Manhattan swim in 6 hours 52 minutes 50 seconds. In August 2017 he completed the Catalina leg in 9:14:41, reported to the nearest minute as 9 hours 15 minutes.",
    "The Catalina federation records 9 hours 14 minutes 41 seconds on 21 August 2017. In New York the 15 August 2016 Manhattan circuit took 6 hours 52 minutes 50 seconds."
